<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag started as a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter initiated coverage of Maytag Corp with a buy recommendation, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Craig Fanning was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Maytag shares were up 1/8 to 20-3/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
